issues: Cauldron for more info
title: "Cauldron" error code
color: failure

---

This error appears when the Bedrock client timed out when trying to authenticate with Microsoft's authentication servers.
Usually this means the authentication servers are down. You may try to resolve this issue by following [Mojang's guide](https://help.minecraft.net/hc/en-us/articles/36735341087629).
